  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementation of the Election Follow-up Mission (EFM) to Kosovo 2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The European Union intends to send an Election Follow-up Mission (EFM) to Kosovo (as per United Nations Security Council resolution 1244 (1999)) to assess the progress made in the electoral reform and the status of implementation of EU Election Observation Mission&apos;s (EOM) recommendations, since the delivery of the final report of the 2021 EU EOM to Kosovo (as per United Nations Security Council resolution 1244 (1999)). IOM will select 2 experts (one Legal and one Electoral Expert) and will be responsible for the implementation of the mission (logistics, admin and security). IOM will have NO visibility and will not be associated to the reports or the work of the Experts.</narrative>
  </description>
